<section class="bg-off-white px-6 pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto bg-navy rounded-[32px] px-10 py-14 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-[60px] -right-[60px] w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(200,165,90,0.2)_0%,transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h2 class="text-[clamp(22px,3vw,32px)] font-black text-white tracking-[-0.02em] mb-3 relative z-10">Siap Wujudkan Niat Suci Anda?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-1.7 mb-7 relative z-10 font-sans">
      Mulai hari ini. Kursi terbatas, prioritas untuk yang lebih awal mendaftar.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gold-alt to-gold-alt-light no-underline text-[15px] font-extrabold text-navy shadow-[0_6px_28px_rgba(200,165,90,0.4)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(200,165,90,0.55)] relative z-10">
